# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/
/gen/schemas

# Generated by `tauri android init` - a full Gradle project (300MB+ with build output),
# regenerate locally with that command rather than committing it. Contains machine-
# specific paths (local.properties) and build artifacts that don't belong in git history.
/gen/android

# The Offline Edition's bundled .NET backend (~125MB self-contained single-file exe) - built via
# `dotnet publish -r win-x64 --self-contained -p:PublishSingleFile=true` (see Phase 2 of the
# plan), not something to commit to git. Regenerate locally/in CI before `tauri build`.
/binaries/
